<title>UK: LME - Warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - Warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Aug 18 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 3725, tin down 30, lead down 200, zinc down 3125, aluminium up 6650, nickel up 132, aluminium alloy down 20.</p>
</text>
